[{"answer":"Right... let's try and get it sorted out today","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-1-2023-08-16-18-10-55/1.mp3"},{"answer":"so we don't have it hanging over us. Okay?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-1-2023-08-16-18-10-55/2.mp3"},{"answer":"Good idea. I'll take notes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-1-2023-08-16-18-10-55/3.mp3"},{"answer":"First thing... numbers...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-1-2023-08-16-18-10-55/4.mp3"},{"answer":"have we got anything definite?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-1-2023-08-16-18-10-55/5.mp3"},{"answer":"Well... I've been working it out and I think 40 to 43.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-1-2023-08-16-18-10-55/6.mp3"},{"answer":"Shall we put 45 to be on the safe side?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-1-2023-08-16-18-10-55/7.mp3"},{"answer":"Yep, fine.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-1-2023-08-16-18-10-55/8.mp3"},{"answer":"Dates... well, that's straightforward.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-1-2023-08-16-18-10-55/9.mp3"},{"answer":"The last working day before Christmas... which is...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-1-2023-08-16-18-10-55/10.mp3"},{"answer":"which is December the 21st.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-1-2023-08-16-18-10-55/11.mp3"},{"answer":"which is going to be pretty difficult to book at Christmas","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-1-2023-08-16-18-10-55/12.mp3"},{"answer":"so we'd better think of two or three places just to be on the safe side.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-1-2023-08-16-18-10-55/13.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, last year's was hopeless.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-1-2023-08-16-18-10-55/14.mp3"},{"answer":"The Red Lion, wasn't it?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-1-2023-08-16-18-10-55/15.mp3"},{"answer":"Yep.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-1-2023-08-16-18-10-55/16.mp3"},{"answer":"We ought to go for something more expensive, cos you...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-1-2023-08-16-18-10-55/17.mp3"},{"answer":"...you gets what you pay for.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-1-2023-08-16-18-10-55/18.mp3"},{"answer":"That new Indian restaurant in Wetherfield is supposed to be excellent...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-1-2023-08-16-18-10-55/19.mp3"},{"answer":"the Rajdoot.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-1-2023-08-16-18-10-55/20.mp3"},{"answer":"How do you spell that?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-1-2023-08-16-18-10-55/21.mp3"},{"answer":"RAJDOOT.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-1-2023-08-16-18-10-55/22.mp3"},{"answer":"But it's bound to be packed.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-1-2023-08-16-18-10-55/23.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, let's put that down as the first choice and have some back-ups.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-1-2023-08-16-18-10-55/24.mp3"},{"answer":"What about the Park View Hotel as a second choice?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-1-2023-08-16-18-10-55/25.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, that's always reliable.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-1-2023-08-16-18-10-55/26.mp3"},{"answer":"Park View Hotel...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-1-2023-08-16-18-10-55/27.mp3"},{"answer":"And the London Arms in case.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-1-2023-08-16-18-10-55/28.mp3"},{"answer":"London Arms...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-1-2023-08-16-18-10-55/29.mp3"},{"answer":"I'll call them now if you want.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-1-2023-08-16-18-10-55/30.mp3"},{"answer":"No. I'll do it, Joan.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-1-2023-08-16-18-10-55/31.mp3"},{"answer":"You're really busy.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-1-2023-08-16-18-10-55/32.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, have you got the numbers?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-1-2023-08-16-18-10-55/33.mp3"},{"answer":"Not for the Rajdoot, but...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-1-2023-08-16-18-10-55/34.mp3"},{"answer":"right... Park View Hotel:","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-1-2023-08-16-18-10-55/35.mp3"},{"answer":"777192.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-1-2023-08-16-18-10-55/36.mp3"},{"answer":"And London Arms: 208657.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-1-2023-08-16-18-10-55/37.mp3"},{"answer":"Great.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-1-2023-08-16-18-10-55/38.mp3"},{"answer":"Before I ring, we'd better just make sure they're within the price range.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-1-2023-08-16-18-10-55/39.mp3"},{"answer":"Up to £15 a head?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-1-2023-08-16-18-10-55/40.mp3"},{"answer":"I think you'll find some people won't be able to go that high.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-1-2023-08-16-18-10-55/41.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, you can't get anything decent under £10.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-1-2023-08-16-18-10-55/42.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-1-2023-08-16-18-10-55/43.mp3"},{"answer":"We'll say £12?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-1-2023-08-16-18-10-55/44.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-1-2023-08-16-18-10-55/45.mp3"},{"answer":"And we'd better make sure there's good vegetarian food.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-1-2023-08-16-18-10-55/46.mp3"},{"answer":"And a non-smoking section!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-1-2023-08-16-18-10-55/47.mp3"},{"answer":"You know what the boss is like.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-1-2023-08-16-18-10-55/48.mp3"},{"answer":"Don't remind me.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-1-2023-08-16-18-10-55/49.mp3"},{"answer":"I'll let you know as soon as I get anything.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-1-2023-08-16-18-10-55/50.mp3"},{"answer":"Good news. I found Rajdoot's number straight away","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-1-2023-08-16-18-10-55/51.mp3"},{"answer":"and they can fit us in.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-1-2023-08-16-18-10-55/52.mp3"},{"answer":"Their Christmas menu sounds great.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-1-2023-08-16-18-10-55/53.mp3"},{"answer":"What is it?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-1-2023-08-16-18-10-55/54.mp3"},{"answer":"French onion soup or fruit juice.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-1-2023-08-16-18-10-55/55.mp3"},{"answer":"Roast dinner or lentil curry...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-1-2023-08-16-18-10-55/56.mp3"},{"answer":"sounds ordinary but my friend said it was really tasty.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-1-2023-08-16-18-10-55/57.mp3"},{"answer":"Umm... lentil curry... that's unusual.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-1-2023-08-16-18-10-55/58.mp3"},{"answer":"And then for dessert, there's traditional plum pudding","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-1-2023-08-16-18-10-55/59.mp3"},{"answer":"or apple pie, plus coffee.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-1-2023-08-16-18-10-55/60.mp3"},{"answer":"That sounds really good for £12.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-1-2023-08-16-18-10-55/61.mp3"},{"answer":"Did you book it?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-1-2023-08-16-18-10-55/62.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, I said I'd check with the staff first.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-1-2023-08-16-18-10-55/63.mp3"},{"answer":"But they did say they'd hold the booking until next Wednesday anyway.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-1-2023-08-16-18-10-55/64.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, and if we go ahead, they'd like a £50 deposit.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-1-2023-08-16-18-10-55/65.mp3"},{"answer":"50 is normal... that's fine.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-1-2023-08-16-18-10-55/66.mp3"},{"answer":"And they want a letter.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-1-2023-08-16-18-10-55/67.mp3"},{"answer":"Right... to confirm.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-1-2023-08-16-18-10-55/68.mp3"},{"answer":"They say with such large numbers we have to choose the menu in advance.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-1-2023-08-16-18-10-55/69.mp3"},{"answer":"That won't be a problem.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-1-2023-08-16-18-10-55/70.mp3"},{"answer":"I'll put up a notice with details of the restaurant and the menu.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-1-2023-08-16-18-10-55/71.mp3"},{"answer":"When did you say they wanted confirmation by?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-1-2023-08-16-18-10-55/72.mp3"},{"answer":"It was... let's see...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-1-2023-08-16-18-10-55/73.mp3"},{"answer":"the 4th of November.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-1-2023-08-16-18-10-55/74.mp3"},{"answer":"Where do you think I should put up the notice?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-1-2023-08-16-18-10-55/75.mp3"},{"answer":"Where everyone's guaranteed to see it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-1-2023-08-16-18-10-55/76.mp3"},{"answer":"On the café noticeboard I should think.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-1-2023-08-16-18-10-55/77.mp3"},{"answer":"Hardly anyone looks at that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-1-2023-08-16-18-10-55/78.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, the Newsletter is probably your best bet.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-1-2023-08-16-18-10-55/79.mp3"},{"answer":"Good idea.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-1-2023-08-16-18-10-55/80.mp3"},{"answer":"I'll go and do that now.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-1-2023-08-16-18-10-55/81.mp3"}]
